        "original_id": "eade5a2c-71c6-5e2a-aea9-7de7c78c0dcc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Baadshah, Mr. Nice Guy, Hello Brother, Akhiyon Se Goli Maare, Nick of Time, Rush Hour, If Looks Could Kill, The Mask\n- People: Abbas-Mustan, Sammo Hung, Jackie Chan, Richard Norton, Razak Khan\n- Topics: film inspiration, cast, comic roles\n\nFacts:\n- Mr. Nice Guy is a 1997 Hong Kong action film directed by Sammo Hung, who also makes a cameo as an unfortunate cyclist.\n- Mr. Nice Guy stars Jackie Chan and Richard Norton.\n- Baadshah is a 1999 Indian action comedy film directed by Abbas-Mustan.\n- Baadshah was inspired by Nick of Time, Rush Hour, If Looks Could Kill, Mr. Nice Guy, and The Mask.\n- Razak Khan was known for playing Manikchand in the 1999 Abbas-Mustan film Baadshah.\n- Razak Khan was also known for playing Ninja Chacha in the 1999 film Hello Brother and Takkar Pehelwan in Akhiyon Se Goli Maare.",
